disappear one by one.

00:19:17.722 --> 00:19:19.023
It's pretty amazing.

00:19:19.123 --> 00:19:21.025
You can actually see it pretty
clearly with this camera here.

00:19:21.125 --> 00:19:23.628 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you see that the red
stripe that was at the bottom

00:19:23.728 --> 00:19:25.964
has completely disappeared.

00:19:26.064 --> 00:19:28.299 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it's now getting
closer to sort of the middle,

00:19:28.399 --> 00:19:30.636
uh, green stripe that is?

00:19:30.736 --> 00:19:32.938 align:start size:94% position:6%
ROSS: Yeah. So we've lost
about one and a half stripes.

00:19:33.038 --> 00:19:34.872 align:start size:81% position:19%
MARIANA: So this
can only happen why?

00:19:34.973 --> 00:19:37.409
ROSS: Because of the
curvature of the earth.

00:19:37.843 --> 00:19:39.811
So then here's what
we were shooting.

00:19:39.911 --> 00:19:42.780
MARIANA: But Mark Sargent and
the other Flat Earthers have a

00:19:42.881 --> 00:19:45.650 align:start size:97% position:3%
very different
interpretation of the results.

00:19:45.750 --> 00:19:48.619
So you don't think what we
are seeing is actually real.

00:19:48.719 --> 00:19:49.888
You think it's because of.

00:19:49.988 --> 00:19:51.323 align:start size:72% position:28%
MARK: Yeah.
MARIANA: Heat.

00:19:51.423 --> 00:19:52.824
MARK: Absolutely heat.

00:19:52.924 --> 00:19:55.059
Does anyone here from Flat
Earth believe it's a globe?

00:19:55.159 --> 00:19:57.229
FLAT EARTHER: It's still flat.

00:19:57.329 --> 00:19:58.997
MARK: Anyone?
Raise of hands.

00:19:59.097 --> 00:20:01.466
FLAT EARTHER: No, and
it's not a pear either.

00:20:01.566 --> 00:20:03.668 align:start size:88% position:13%
MARIANA: This
demonstration it doesn't
change anything for you?

00:20:03.768 --> 00:20:05.336
MARK: Good Lord, no.

00:20:05.436 --> 00:20:06.838 align:start size:91% position:9%
MARIANA: Mark, do you
really believe this stuff?

00:20:06.938 --> 00:20:08.640
Tell me the truth. I'm serious.

00:20:08.740 --> 00:20:12.510 align:start position:0%
MARK: I absolutely 100% believe
we are not on a globe,

00:20:12.610 --> 00:20:15.413
